Ось повний архів вашого проекту. Це "знімок" стану вашого двигуна, який включає всі виправлення, архітектуру бібліотеки (`@engine`), систему сценаріїв та UI в стилі Mozaik.  Ви можете скопіювати ці файли у новий проект, і він одразу запрацює.  ### 📦 Структура Проекту  Спочатку створіть таку структуру папок:  ```text my-engine/ ├── src/ │   ├── engine/ │   │   ├── core/ │   │   │   ├── components/      <-- MeshRenderer тут (якщо будете робити) │   │   │   ├── math/            <-- Vector3.ts, Quaternion.ts │   │   │   ├── scenario/        <-- Scenario.ts, ScenarioTypes.ts, ScenarioRepository.ts │   │   │   ├── Application.ts │   │   │   ├── Behaviour.ts │   │   │   ├── Component.ts │   │   │   ├── EngineObject.ts │   │   │   ├── EngineSettings.ts │   │   │   ├── GameObject.ts │   │   │   ├── Scene.ts │   │   │   ├── SceneManager.ts │   │   │   ├── ScriptableBehaviour.ts │   │   │   ├── Time.ts │   │   │   └── Transform.ts │   │   └── index.ts             <-- Головний файл бібліотеки │   ├── scenarios/ │   │   └── SolarSystem/ │   │       ├── assets/          <-- Локальні картинки сценарію │   │       ├── manifest.ts │   │       └── SolarSystemScenario.ts │   ├── main.ts │   └── vite-env.d.ts ├── index.html ├── style.css ├── tsconfig.json ├── vite.config.ts └── package.json  ```  ---  ### 1. Конфігурація (Корінь)  **`package.json`** (залежності)  ```bash npm install three uuid npm install -D typescript vite @types/three @types/uuid @types/node  ```  **`tsconfig.json`**  ```json {   "compilerOptions": {     "target": "ES2022",     "module": "ESNext",     "lib": ["ES2022", "DOM", "DOM.Iterable"],     "moduleResolution": "bundler",     "allowImportingTsExtensions": true,     "noEmit": true,     "strict": true,     "baseUrl": "./",     "paths": {       "@engine": ["src/engine/index.ts"]     },     "types": ["vite/client", "node"]   },   "include": ["src/**/*.ts"] }  ```  **`vite.config.ts`**  ```typescript import { defineConfig } from 'vite'; import path from 'path';  export default defineConfig({   resolve: {     alias: {       '@engine': path.resolve(__dirname, './src/engine/index.ts')     }   } });  ```  **`src/vite-env.d.ts`** (Для імпорту картинок)  ```typescript /// <reference types="vite/client" /> declare module "*.jpg" { const value: string; export default value; } declare module "*.png" { const value: string; export default value; }  ```  ---  ### 2. UI та Вхідна Точка  **`index.html`**  ```html <!DOCTYPE html> <html lang="uk"> <head>   <meta charset="UTF-8" />   <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />   <title>University 3D Labs</title>   <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">   <link rel="stylesheet" href="./style.css"> </head> <body>   <div id="menu-screen">     <header>       <div class="logo"><span>🎓</span> University 3D Labs</div>     </header>     <div style="padding-top: 40px;">       <h1>Доступні Лабораторні Роботи</h1>       <div class="scenario-grid"></div>     </div>   </div>    <div id="app-screen">     <button id="back-btn"><span>←</span> Назад в меню</button>     <canvas id="webgl-canvas"></canvas>   </div>    <script type="module" src="/src/main.ts"></script> </body> </html>  ```  **`style.css`** (Mozaik Design)  ```css :root { --primary-color: #007bff; --bg-color: #f4f7f6; --card-bg: #ffffff; --radius: 12px; } body { margin: 0; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: var(--bg-color); color: #333; } header { background: var(--card-bg); padding: 15px 40px; display: flex; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); } .logo { font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-color); font-size: 1.5rem; } #menu-screen { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px; } .scenario-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 25px; }  .card { background: white; border-radius: var(--radius); cursor: pointer; transition: 0.3s; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); display: flex; flex-direction: column; } .card:hover { transform: translateY(-8px); box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.12); } .card-image-wrapper { height: 180px; background: #eee; position: relative; overflow: hidden; } .card-img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: 0.5s; } .card:hover .card-img { transform: scale(1.05); } .play-overlay { position: absolute; top:0; left:0; width:100%; height:100%; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; opacity: 0; transition: 0.3s; } .card:hover .play-overlay { opacity: 1; } .play-icon { width: 50px; height: 50px; background: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; color: var(--primary-color); font-size: 24px; } .card-content { padding: 20px; } .card-category { font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--primary-color); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; } .card h3 { margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 1.1rem; } .card p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 3; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; overflow: hidden; }  #app-screen { display: none; position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: black; z-index: 200; } canvas { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; } #back-btn { position: absolute; top: 20px; left: 20px; background: white; border: none; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 30px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; z-index: 10; }  ```  **`src/main.ts`** (Каталог та Запуск)  ```typescript import { Application, SceneManager } from "@engine"; import { ScenarioRepository } from "./engine/core/scenario/ScenarioRepository";  const app = new Application(document.getElementById("webgl-canvas") as HTMLCanvasElement); const repo = new ScenarioRepository(); const manifests = repo.getAllManifests();  const ui = {     menu: document.getElementById("menu-screen") as HTMLDivElement,     grid: document.querySelector(".scenario-grid") as HTMLDivElement,     app: document.getElementById("app-screen") as HTMLDivElement,     backBtn: document.getElementById("back-btn") as HTMLButtonElement, };  function toggleScreen(showGame: boolean) {     if (showGame) {         ui.menu.style.display = 'none';         ui.app.style.display = 'block';     } else {         ui.app.style.display = 'none';         ui.menu.style.display = 'block';         app.stop();         SceneManager.loadScene("MenuBackground");      } }  ui.backBtn.addEventListener("click", () => toggleScreen(false)); ui.grid.innerHTML = "";  manifests.forEach((manifest) => {     const card = document.createElement("div");     card.className = "card";          // HTML Структура картки     card.innerHTML = `         <div class="card-image-wrapper">             <img src="${manifest.previewImage || ''}" class="card-img" alt="${manifest.name}">             <div class="play-overlay"><div class="play-icon">▶</div></div>         </div>         <div class="card-content">             <div class="card-category">${manifest.category}</div>             <h3>${manifest.name}</h3>             <p>${manifest.description}</p>         </div>     `;      card.addEventListener("click", async () => {         toggleScreen(true);         try {             const ScenarioClass = await repo.loadScenarioCode(manifest.id);             const scenarioInstance = new ScenarioClass();             SceneManager.loadScene(manifest.name);             await scenarioInstance.load();             app.run();         } catch (e) {             console.error(e);             alert("Помилка запуску!");             toggleScreen(false);         }     });     ui.grid.appendChild(card); });  ```  ---  ### 3. Engine Core (`src/engine/`)  **`src/engine/index.ts`** (Public API)  ```typescript export { GameObject } from "./core/GameObject"; export { Component } from "./core/Component"; export { Scenario } from "./core/scenario/Scenario"; export { SceneManager } from "./core/SceneManager"; export { Application } from "./core/Application"; export { ScriptableBehaviour } from "./core/ScriptableBehaviour"; export { Transform } from "./core/Transform"; export { Vector3 } from "./core/math/Vector3"; export { Quaternion } from "./core/math/Quaternion"; export { Time } from "./core/Time"; export { ScenarioCategory } from "./core/scenario/ScenarioTypes"; export type { IScenarioManifest } from "./core/scenario/ScenarioTypes";  ```  **`src/engine/core/EngineSettings.ts`**  ```typescript export const EngineSettings = {     Time: { FIXED_TIMESTEP: 1 / 50, MAX_DELTA_TIME: 0.1 },     Physics: { GRAVITY: -9.81, DEFAULT_SOLVER_ITERATIONS: 6 },     Math: { EPSILON: 0.00001 },     Layers: { DEFAULT: 0, UI: 5 },     Tags: { UNTAGGED: "Untagged", MAIN_CAMERA: "MainCamera" },     Defaults: { GAME_OBJECT_NAME: "New GameObject" } } as const;  ```  **`src/engine/core/Time.ts`** (Оновлений з минулого разу)  ```typescript export class Time {     static deltaTime: number = 0;     static fixedDeltaTime: number = 1 / 50;     static time: number = 0;     static frameCount: number = 0;     static timeScale: number = 1.0;     static _update(dt: number) {         Time.deltaTime = dt * Time.timeScale;         Time.time += Time.deltaTime;         Time.frameCount++;     } }  ```  **`src/engine/core/Application.ts`** (Game Loop)  ```typescript import * as THREE from "three"; import { SceneManager } from "./SceneManager"; import { Time } from "./Time"; import { EngineSettings } from "./EngineSettings";  export class Application {     public readonly renderer: THREE.WebGLRenderer;     public readonly canvas: HTMLCanvasElement;     public isPlaying: boolean = false;     private _fixedUpdateAccumulator: number = 0;     private _lastFrameTime: number = 0;      constructor(canvas: HTMLCanvasElement) {         this.canvas = canvas;         this.renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, antialias: true });         this.renderer.setPixelRatio(window.devicePixelRatio);         this.resize();         window.addEventListener('resize', () => this.resize());     }      public run(): void {         if (this.isPlaying) return;         this.isPlaying = true;         this._lastFrameTime = performance.now();         this.loop();     }      public stop(): void { this.isPlaying = false; }      private loop = (): void => {         if (!this.isPlaying) return;         requestAnimationFrame(this.loop);         const now = performance.now();         let frameDelta = (now - this._lastFrameTime) / 1000;         this._lastFrameTime = now;         if (frameDelta > EngineSettings.Time.MAX_DELTA_TIME) frameDelta = EngineSettings.Time.MAX_DELTA_TIME;          Time._update(frameDelta);         this._fixedUpdateAccumulator += frameDelta;         while (this._fixedUpdateAccumulator >= EngineSettings.Time.FIXED_TIMESTEP) {             SceneManager.activeScene._fixedUpdate();             this._fixedUpdateAccumulator -= EngineSettings.Time.FIXED_TIMESTEP;         }         SceneManager.activeScene._update();         SceneManager.activeScene._lateUpdate();         this.render();     };      private render(): void {         const scene = SceneManager.activeScene;         let mainCamera: THREE.Camera | null = null;         scene.threeScene.traverse((obj) => {             if (!mainCamera && (obj as THREE.Camera).isCamera) mainCamera = obj as THREE.Camera;         });         if (mainCamera) this.renderer.render(scene.threeScene, mainCamera);         else this.renderer.clear();     }      private resize(): void {         this.renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);     } }  ```  **`src/engine/core/scenario/ScenarioRepository.ts`** (Auto-Discovery)  ```typescript import { IScenarioManifest } from "./ScenarioTypes"; import { Scenario } from "./Scenario";  export class ScenarioRepository {     private _manifestsGlob = import.meta.glob('../../../../scenarios/**/manifest.ts', { eager: true });     private _manifests: IScenarioManifest[] = [];      constructor() {         this._discoverScenarios();     }      private _discoverScenarios() {         for (const path in this._manifestsGlob) {             const module = this._manifestsGlob[path] as { default: IScenarioManifest };             const manifest = module.default;             if (manifest && manifest.main) {                 this._manifests.push(manifest);             }         }     }      public getAllManifests(): IScenarioManifest[] { return this._manifests; }      public async loadScenarioCode(id: string): Promise<new () => Scenario> {         const manifest = this._manifests.find(m => m.id === id);         if (!manifest) throw new Error(`Scenario not found: ${id}`);         const module = await manifest.main();         return module.default;     } }  ```  ---  ### 4. Math (`src/engine/core/math/`)  Використовуйте надані вами раніше `Vector3.ts` та `Quaternion.ts` (ті, що ви скидали, вони правильні).  ---  ### 5. Приклад Сценарію (`src/scenarios/`)  **`src/scenarios/SolarSystem/manifest.ts`**  ```typescript import { IScenarioManifest, ScenarioCategory } from "@engine"; // Якщо картинки нема, можна поки закоментувати previewImage // import previewImg from "./assets/solar_preview.jpg";   const manifest: IScenarioManifest = {     id: "solar-system-2026",     name: "Сонячна Система",     description: "Інтерактивна модель орбіт планет.",     category: ScenarioCategory.Astronomy,     previewImage: "", // previewImg     version: "1.0.0",     author: "Кафедра Астрономії",     main: () => import("./SolarSystemScenario.ts")  }; export default manifest;  ```  **`src/scenarios/SolarSystem/SolarSystemScenario.ts`**  ```typescript import { Scenario, GameObject, Vector3 } from "@engine"; import * as THREE from "three"; // Тимчасово для візуалізації  export default class SolarSystemScenario extends Scenario {     public async init(): Promise<void> {         console.log("Solar System Init");          // Камера         const camGO = this.createGameObject("Main Camera");         const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(75, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);         camGO.transform.object3D.add(camera);         camGO.transform.position = new Vector3(0, 5, 10);         camGO.transform.lookAt(new Vector3(0, 0, 0));          // Сонце         const sun = this.createGameObject("Sun");         const sunGeo = new THREE.SphereGeometry(1);         const sunMat = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: 0xffff00 });         sun.transform.object3D.add(new THREE.Mesh(sunGeo, sunMat));          // Земля         const earth = this.createGameObject("Earth");         const earthGeo = new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.5);         const earthMat = new THREE.MeshNormalMaterial();         earth.transform.object3D.add(new THREE.Mesh(earthGeo, earthMat));         earth.transform.position = new Vector3(5, 0, 0);                  // Ієрархія (Сонце -> Земля)         earth.transform.parent = sun.transform;     } }  ```

